  "_source": "https://github.com/sainnhe/everforest/blob/master/palette.md (Dark, Medium)",
  "_aliases": [
    "Everforest ships seven accents for fourteen semantic names, so several",
    "names share a value. That is what the schema is for: every template then",
    "renders for every palette without a single conditional.",
    "  red = maroon        (one red)",
    "  peach = flamingo = rosewater  (one orange)",
    "  teal = sky          (one aqua)",
    "  blue = sapphire     (one blue)",
    "  mauve = pink = lavender       (one purple)",
    "crust and mantle share bg_dim: Everforest has nothing between bg_dim and",
    "bg0, and inventing a hex would be worse than aliasing an honest one."
  ],
